WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:12.070
Aeti.

00:16.220 --> 00:17.780
Did I wake you up?

00:18.920 --> 00:20.330
What's going on?

00:20.330 --> 00:22.220
Something good's about to happen.

00:22.780 --> 00:24.860
I wanted you to be there to see it.

00:25.540 --> 00:27.210
Is it important?

00:27.210 --> 00:28.580
Yes, it is.

00:29.050 --> 00:30.620
As important as you are.

00:34.130 --> 00:36.380
I'm still sleepy.

00:36.380 --> 00:37.690
You can go back to sleep.

00:53.260 --> 00:54.390
Oscar?

00:54.940 --> 00:56.320
Yes, it's me.

00:56.810 --> 00:58.160
I'm sorry.

00:58.160 --> 00:59.660
I had a bad dream.

01:00.060 --> 01:01.690
Because you fall asleep sitting up.

01:02.350 --> 01:03.940
Get some proper rest when you sleep.

01:06.070 --> 01:07.630
You have a point.

01:08.990 --> 01:10.620
<i>That dream again...</i>

02:43.180 --> 02:48.020
~ Unnamed Emotion ~

02:54.450 --> 02:55.450
Thanks.

03:01.820 --> 03:02.810
Your Highness.

03:02.810 --> 03:04.280
His Majesty wants to see you.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.460
Father does?

03:07.260 --> 03:09.370
I haven't fully investigated the matter...

03:09.370 --> 03:12.280
Were you discussing something 
with my protector?

03:12.940 --> 03:16.460
Yes, I was seeking counsel from her.

03:16.460 --> 03:19.070
It's about your bride.

03:19.420 --> 03:20.310
What?

03:21.130 --> 03:26.300
Your future queen needs to have 
high magical resistance, am I wrong?

03:27.030 --> 03:33.420
I've asked Miss Tinasha to see whether 
the girl in question meets our needs.

03:33.420 --> 03:34.340
What girl?

03:39.230 --> 03:41.730
I think it would be barely possible for her.

03:42.340 --> 03:43.780
Who are we talking about?

03:43.780 --> 03:45.530
You haven't realized it?

03:49.140 --> 03:50.370
Miralys?

03:51.000 --> 03:52.250
Bingo.

03:53.690 --> 03:55.460
You were aware as well?

03:55.460 --> 03:56.170
Yes.

03:56.170 --> 03:57.780
Her magical power is sealed away,

03:57.780 --> 04:01.220
but in terms of capacity, hers easily 
exceeds that of a court mage.

04:02.310 --> 04:05.300
I figured she would be a potential 
candidate as your bride.

04:05.860 --> 04:10.030
It seems her family passes down 
magic through their bloodline.

04:11.230 --> 04:15.900
When one generation dies, 
their descendants inherit their magic.

04:15.900 --> 04:18.110
How come I wasn't told of this?

04:18.420 --> 04:20.850
I thought you'd bristle at the idea.

04:20.850 --> 04:21.980
Like you are now.

04:21.980 --> 04:22.930
Now look here...

04:22.930 --> 04:24.060
That's enough.

04:24.900 --> 04:28.690
Everyone is doing what they can for your sake.

04:29.370 --> 04:31.160
This is a good opportunity.

04:31.480 --> 04:34.620
Don't be arrogant and try 
to solve it all on your own.

04:34.620 --> 04:36.650
Why don't you get to know Miralys better?

04:40.420 --> 04:41.460
Miralys.

04:42.660 --> 04:45.260
I hear your magic has been sealed away.

04:45.730 --> 04:46.970
Who was responsible?

04:47.530 --> 04:48.560
My mother.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.930
And Master Kumu reinforced it as well.

04:50.930 --> 04:53.590
I see. A twofold seal?

04:54.410 --> 04:57.620
That aside, how come she hasn't been around?

04:57.620 --> 04:59.270
Do you mean Lady Tinasha?

04:59.270 --> 05:01.660
I haven't seen her in the past week or so.

05:01.660 --> 05:03.240
Where has she been?

05:03.240 --> 05:05.010
B-Beats me...

05:05.990 --> 05:07.950
My apologies.

05:08.320 --> 05:11.270
No, you don't need to apologize.

05:12.660 --> 05:14.770
They found a potential princess?!

05:14.770 --> 05:15.710
Yes.

05:15.710 --> 05:19.500
Which means I'm off the hook for that now.

05:19.920 --> 05:23.820
Besides, it's a good thing for him 
to have more choices.

05:24.220 --> 05:25.720
Especially for marriage partners.

05:25.720 --> 05:28.010
The more the merrier, wouldn't you say?

05:28.630 --> 05:31.650
I'd feel bad if I was the only choice he had.

05:32.670 --> 05:34.720
Are you being serious here?

05:34.720 --> 05:35.270
Yes.

05:35.770 --> 05:38.290
I don't really have time for jokes.

05:40.140 --> 05:41.140
Hey.

05:42.010 --> 05:45.160
You may be a witch, 
but more importantly, you're human.

05:46.380 --> 05:48.570
Can I go back to my analysis?

05:52.770 --> 05:55.150
Master Tinasha. Master Tinasha.

05:55.150 --> 05:56.160
What is it?

05:56.160 --> 05:58.120
A challenger has arrived.

05:58.440 --> 06:00.660
I thought I closed off the entrance.

06:00.660 --> 06:03.090
He used a teleport circle to make his way in.

06:03.090 --> 06:04.290
Prince Oscar, that is.

06:04.830 --> 06:05.960
Tinasha.

06:05.960 --> 06:07.050
Ugh...

06:07.050 --> 06:08.930
Is that any way to greet me?

06:09.470 --> 06:13.860
New records set for both 
smallest party and shortest time.

06:13.860 --> 06:17.020
You've really surpassed 
the limits of a normal human.

06:17.020 --> 06:19.010
That's the least of my concerns right now.

06:19.480 --> 06:21.980
Why have you been hiding from me?

06:21.980 --> 06:23.850
I've been busy.

06:23.850 --> 06:25.140
Trying to break this.

06:25.140 --> 06:27.220
There's no need to rush it.

06:27.220 --> 06:29.700
I want to finish it while I can.

06:32.890 --> 06:35.930
The blessing placed on you 
by the Witch of Silence...

06:35.930 --> 06:38.160
It's truly quite elegant.

06:38.160 --> 06:41.760
It comes together beautifully, 
despite its complex, delicate composition.

06:41.760 --> 06:43.270
Is that so?

06:44.180 --> 06:49.010
Seeing this, I realize that love and hatred 
are two sides of the same coin.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.460
I find it... quite frightening.

06:51.460 --> 06:52.560
Frightening?

06:52.560 --> 06:54.220
What are you scared of?

07:02.000 --> 07:04.940
Whenever you're free, make me dinner.

07:08.050 --> 07:09.400
Sure thing.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.690
Miss Tinasha!

07:15.550 --> 07:16.690
Found you!

07:16.690 --> 07:18.580
I've been looking all over!

07:21.020 --> 07:23.610
I wanted to talk to you about Miralys.

07:23.610 --> 07:24.470
Yes?

07:25.000 --> 07:27.400
Looking through General Ettard's belongings,

07:27.400 --> 07:30.090
we couldn't find anything tying her to him.

07:31.610 --> 07:32.660
I see.

07:33.050 --> 07:37.050
That got me curious, so I looked into her 
background, but it turned up nothing.

07:37.050 --> 07:40.380
Is it really okay to consider her for princess?

07:40.910 --> 07:42.250
You too?

07:42.250 --> 07:42.900
Huh?

07:43.210 --> 07:45.850
Actually, when I first arrived at this castle,

07:45.850 --> 07:52.350
I searched across the mainland for 
a woman who could be Oscar's wife.

07:52.350 --> 07:55.480
But I found no one other than the witches.

07:55.480 --> 07:59.370
Isn't that because Miralys's grandmother 
still had her power back then?

07:59.760 --> 08:02.830
If I excluded by age, the witches 
would have been the first to go.

08:02.830 --> 08:08.050
But even so, there were no women 
who had as much power as Miralys does now.

08:08.320 --> 08:11.260
So you mean she's hiding something.

08:11.690 --> 08:14.320
However, I don't know whether 
she's after the Farsas royal family

08:14.320 --> 08:18.220
or whether she wants to drag 
me away from this place.

08:18.220 --> 08:20.930
If I knew which it was, I could take action.

08:22.850 --> 08:23.880
Perfect timing.

08:23.880 --> 08:25.490
Our chance to uncover the truth.

08:25.490 --> 08:26.170
What?

08:26.740 --> 08:28.510
Oh, I get it.

08:41.910 --> 08:43.880
How devious of you.

08:43.880 --> 08:45.870
It came with perks, so I'll take it.

08:46.380 --> 08:49.570
If she's after His Highness, 
she won't do anything.

08:49.570 --> 08:53.960
But if it's you she's after, she'll take 
some sort of action against me.

08:53.960 --> 08:55.890
I'll take my leave now.

09:08.830 --> 09:10.170
That's...

09:13.180 --> 09:14.250
Oscar.

09:14.250 --> 09:15.570
Did you call for me?

09:15.570 --> 09:16.370
Come in.

09:18.630 --> 09:20.070
What were you up to today?

09:20.490 --> 09:21.990
The same as always.

09:22.660 --> 09:26.380
I did some analysis, listened 
to reports from my familiars...

09:27.460 --> 09:28.990
Is something wrong?

09:33.890 --> 09:34.800
This is...

09:34.800 --> 09:37.420
A sealing ornament with 
the same properties as Akashia.

09:37.420 --> 09:39.550
Only direct royal descendants can handle it.

09:39.550 --> 09:41.420
Where'd you get this thing?!

09:41.420 --> 09:42.510
The royal treasury.

09:46.690 --> 09:48.100
Oscar!

09:48.100 --> 09:52.020
I knew you could be clueless, 
but I thought you were better than this.

09:52.020 --> 09:54.890
I was going to wait patiently, 
but I have my limits.

09:54.890 --> 09:55.650
What?

09:56.400 --> 10:01.310
I didn't bring you here to 
hand you over to another man.

10:01.310 --> 10:05.190
Since you don't understand, I'll teach you 
until you feel it in your bones.

10:13.580 --> 10:14.840
Stop it...

10:15.970 --> 10:17.060
Let me down...

10:18.860 --> 10:20.020
Stop...

10:20.500 --> 10:21.500
Don't...

10:21.500 --> 10:22.500
Tinasha?

10:35.570 --> 10:36.780
Tinasha.

10:45.060 --> 10:46.020
Sorry.

10:46.910 --> 10:49.420
I just wanted to scare you a bit.

10:49.420 --> 10:50.730
It was in poor taste.

10:51.220 --> 10:52.230
I won't do it again.

10:52.630 --> 10:56.220
No, I'm sorry.

10:56.730 --> 10:57.590
No.

10:57.590 --> 10:59.540
I'm the one apologizing here.

10:59.540 --> 11:00.830
Why?

11:00.830 --> 11:02.300
Why, you ask?

11:03.410 --> 11:04.260
What?!

11:04.260 --> 11:08.140
You already gave Als a good beating?

11:08.140 --> 11:08.980
My bad.

11:08.980 --> 11:11.620
Tell that to Als!

11:11.620 --> 11:14.440
He was just trying to sound out Miralys.

11:14.440 --> 11:16.400
He didn't suffer any major injuries.

11:16.740 --> 11:19.020
I just sparred with him about ten times.

11:19.020 --> 11:21.460
I'll go heal him up after this.

11:22.360 --> 11:25.860
That said, don't hide information 
about Miralys from me.

11:25.860 --> 11:27.330
She sounds incredibly suspicious.

11:27.830 --> 11:31.360
But its possible she's 
being used by someone else,

11:31.360 --> 11:33.790
and we had no evidence to report to you.

11:34.140 --> 11:37.930
What's more, look at how cute she is.

11:37.930 --> 11:41.820
I didn't want to ruin any chance 
of you falling in love with her.

11:41.820 --> 11:42.680
I swear...

11:43.100 --> 11:45.890
This is what I mean by not understanding!

11:44.910 --> 11:47.110
Ow, ow, ow!

11:45.890 --> 11:47.130
Come with me.

11:50.470 --> 11:51.520
Now's the right time.

11:52.050 --> 11:54.250
I want to make things very clear.

11:54.690 --> 11:58.700
I'm not keeping Tinasha around because 
I don't have any other choices.

11:59.590 --> 12:02.170
She's here because I've taken a liking to her.

12:03.110 --> 12:07.580
So it's pointless and unwelcome to parade 
any other women in front of me.

12:07.890 --> 12:10.040
I won't choose anyone but her.

12:13.930 --> 12:16.010
Surely you understand now.

12:16.010 --> 12:20.420
Be there one, a hundred, or a thousand 
choices, I will always choose you.

12:20.420 --> 12:22.830
So don't complicate things 
and distance yourself.

12:24.800 --> 12:26.200
That's the truth of the matter.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.970
Unfortunately, I have no intent 
to make you my wife.

12:29.290 --> 12:33.020
You'll be removed from your position for now, 
so we can look into your background.

12:33.020 --> 12:35.020
U-Um, Your Highness...

12:35.020 --> 12:36.260
I...

12:37.010 --> 12:37.840
If you will.

12:37.840 --> 12:38.540
Yes.

12:42.610 --> 12:44.570
The castle's barrier...

12:58.250 --> 12:59.090
Oh no!

12:59.090 --> 13:00.300
Tinasha!

13:00.300 --> 13:01.250
Oscar!

13:01.250 --> 13:02.670
Let go of me!

13:11.100 --> 13:12.220
You're...

13:14.580 --> 13:17.750
I would have left you alone 
if you hadn't caught on.

13:18.570 --> 13:21.070
You broke Kumu's seal by yourself?

13:21.070 --> 13:22.240
Sorry.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.180
Can it be healed?

13:23.620 --> 13:25.530
I'm fine...

13:25.890 --> 13:27.740
More importantly, stand back.

13:28.270 --> 13:32.780
Being splashed with my blood 
has weakened your defensive barrier.

13:33.580 --> 13:35.460
Leave this to me.

13:36.490 --> 13:38.230
Go help evacuate the others.

13:40.090 --> 13:41.340
Good grief.

13:41.340 --> 13:43.300
You sure do underestimate me.

13:44.100 --> 13:46.260
Can you fight looking like that?

13:46.740 --> 13:48.950
<i>I'll need to fight with only my right eye.</i>

13:54.980 --> 13:56.740
That demonic beast...

13:57.870 --> 14:00.100
He entrusted it to me.

14:00.100 --> 14:03.090
You regenerated the beast using its core?

14:03.090 --> 14:04.510
How clever of you.

14:05.490 --> 14:07.060
What are you doing?

14:07.060 --> 14:09.770
You shouldn't be on the front line 
with that eye, either.

14:11.830 --> 14:14.250
Why did you have me undergo all that training?

14:14.250 --> 14:16.910
Allow me the option to 
make up for my mistakes.

14:18.120 --> 14:19.640
But the barrier...

14:19.640 --> 14:20.750
It'll be fine.

14:26.790 --> 14:29.380
If you really insist, then at least 
secure an easy victory.

14:29.970 --> 14:31.850
I won't tolerate any injuries.

14:32.120 --> 14:34.350
Don't suddenly make things harder.

14:34.910 --> 14:35.780
Get him!

14:37.890 --> 14:40.520
Incinerate that which has form by my hand!

14:40.520 --> 14:41.660
Let it be defined.

14:43.540 --> 14:44.450
Why, you!

14:50.820 --> 14:51.820
That was close!

14:54.610 --> 14:58.500
I can't attack or defend against 
that beast without incantations,

14:59.010 --> 15:01.660
so I might not be very useful here.

15:01.660 --> 15:04.710
And you were going to fight it alone?

15:05.140 --> 15:06.710
What about Miralys, then?

15:06.710 --> 15:08.410
I can kill her at any time.

15:08.410 --> 15:09.110
However...

15:11.110 --> 15:13.640
It'd be best to take her alive.

15:13.980 --> 15:16.350
We need to ask her what she's after.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.020
Magic spheres!

15:20.370 --> 15:25.060
I know well enough that I don't stand 
a chance against you head-on.

15:33.190 --> 15:33.660
What?!

15:33.970 --> 15:35.160
It distorted the trajectory!

15:37.100 --> 15:38.220
Burst!

15:40.500 --> 15:42.500
This is troublesome...

15:47.190 --> 15:49.010
If you have a plan, I'm all ears.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.490
There are two options.

15:50.490 --> 15:52.220
One where the palace is half destroyed,

15:52.220 --> 15:54.470
and one where it isn't, 
but that demands a lot from you.

15:54.760 --> 15:56.060
Which do you prefer?

15:56.060 --> 15:56.930
The second one.

15:57.370 --> 15:59.120
Then we'll take a standard approach.

15:59.120 --> 16:01.270
I'll stand back like a good mage,

16:01.660 --> 16:03.520
so you take the front.

16:03.860 --> 16:05.730
Buy me some time.

16:08.830 --> 16:10.420
Commence definition.

16:10.420 --> 16:12.900
What the eye sees is but one of many.

16:13.240 --> 16:16.020
Boundless life is squandered into tranquility.

16:16.490 --> 16:18.920
You should know when to give up,

16:18.920 --> 16:20.950
if you don't want your throat torn out.

16:20.950 --> 16:24.950
Unfortunately, I've gone longer 
without this barrier than with it.

16:25.450 --> 16:28.880
I don't know what you're after, 
but I'll capture you and have you tell me.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.090
Get him!

16:30.090 --> 16:31.550
Flames, consume him!

16:41.640 --> 16:44.100
You used the beast as a shield?!

16:44.100 --> 16:45.980
I was raised with bad manners.

16:47.450 --> 16:49.100
No injuries, huh?

16:49.890 --> 16:52.780
That's rich, considering 
your stomach got torn open.

16:53.590 --> 16:54.740
Okay, my mind is set.

16:58.980 --> 16:59.730
Come at me.

17:00.450 --> 17:02.210
This place will be your graveyard.

17:02.580 --> 17:04.500
Twilight without form...

17:04.500 --> 17:05.710
Contort space!

17:23.990 --> 17:25.010
Sorry.

17:25.010 --> 17:27.900
I'm prepared for any nasty looks I might get.

17:28.370 --> 17:30.790
<i>It's only natural that I buy her time.</i>

17:30.790 --> 17:33.810
<i>I need to be able to handle enemies 
like these if I want to stand by her side!</i>

17:34.730 --> 17:36.320
Incinerate that which has form—

17:36.320 --> 17:37.280
Oh no, you don't.

17:41.220 --> 17:44.300
What... <i>is</i> that?!

17:45.210 --> 17:47.270
Be rid of meaning.

17:52.850 --> 17:54.800
Make sure you let her out later.

17:59.260 --> 18:02.420
You won't lose. Not as long as I'm with you.

18:07.580 --> 18:08.940
Where's Miralys?

18:08.940 --> 18:10.650
I let her escape on purpose.

18:11.390 --> 18:12.790
Where is she headed?

18:14.970 --> 18:16.430
Out of my way...

18:17.170 --> 18:19.660
I finally figured out where it is!

18:25.260 --> 18:26.250
There.

18:26.650 --> 18:27.980
This is it!

18:32.070 --> 18:36.460
I don't know what you're trying 
to steal, but it won't be yours.

18:39.420 --> 18:41.930
I need this, no matter what it takes!

18:42.300 --> 18:44.390
You'd never understand!

18:46.130 --> 18:48.350
I'll tell you now that I'm here.

18:48.930 --> 18:53.130
In the future, you'll be reunited with 
the delusion you've been searching for.

18:53.960 --> 18:54.630
What?

18:55.070 --> 18:58.500
So have fun suffering all by yourself...

18:58.500 --> 19:00.210
Little Miss Queen-to-Be!

19:00.530 --> 19:01.780
Not on my watch.

19:12.170 --> 19:13.080
If only...

19:15.020 --> 19:18.050
If only I had more power...

19:21.050 --> 19:22.230
Don't do it!

19:22.230 --> 19:23.380
Valt...

19:24.570 --> 19:26.150
I'm sorry...

19:39.490 --> 19:40.830
Delusion...

19:41.350 --> 19:42.620
Lanak?

19:42.620 --> 19:43.790
Is she dead?

19:46.140 --> 19:47.010
No.

19:47.980 --> 19:51.740
Her body is alive, but her soul is gone.

19:52.470 --> 19:55.590
She disappeared of her own will.

19:59.070 --> 20:00.130
I see.

20:17.930 --> 20:19.540
That should do it...

20:20.320 --> 20:22.900
Are you really fully healed?

20:22.900 --> 20:24.460
Why the doubtful tone?

20:24.460 --> 20:25.910
I'm all better.

20:26.240 --> 20:28.010
Would you like to make sure?

20:28.990 --> 20:30.530
Sorry about everything.

20:31.370 --> 20:33.880
I should be apologizing, too.

20:33.880 --> 20:38.100
In the end, what was that orb 
she was trying to steal?

20:38.540 --> 20:39.750
Well, you see...

20:40.740 --> 20:42.940
Originally, it didn't belong to Farsas.

20:42.940 --> 20:45.330
It was something my mother brought,

20:45.330 --> 20:48.430
so I'm not certain what it's used for.

20:48.430 --> 20:50.280
Your mother, you say?

20:50.640 --> 20:51.570
Yeah.

20:54.100 --> 20:55.290
What's the matter?

20:55.750 --> 20:58.030
No, it's nothing...

20:58.560 --> 20:59.690
So?

20:59.690 --> 21:02.280
I never got an answer from earlier today.

21:04.210 --> 21:06.450
Do you feel like marrying me yet?

21:10.650 --> 21:13.100
I'll never get married.

21:13.100 --> 21:14.940
You should just give up.

21:15.450 --> 21:16.530
I swear...

21:16.870 --> 21:18.470
I can wait, so it's fine.

21:24.180 --> 21:28.380
<i>Even if you leave yourself 
with only one choice,</i>

21:29.190 --> 21:33.340
<i>I'll give you countless options so you forget.</i>

21:33.860 --> 21:39.970
<i>May the darkness of my past 
that I seek never reach you.</i>

21:40.470 --> 21:43.140
<i>May it not affect the path that you walk down.</i>

21:45.720 --> 21:47.840
Let go of me already.

21:47.840 --> 21:49.370
I'm getting sleepy.

21:49.730 --> 21:51.840
Today has tired me out as well.

21:51.840 --> 21:53.080
Should we sleep together?

21:53.080 --> 21:53.960
Get out!

21:53.960 --> 21:56.180
I'll hurl you back to your room 
with teleportation!

21:57.870 --> 22:00.500
<i>May the day I let go of 
this hand come one day.</i>

22:01.510 --> 22:02.970
